  "marks": 5,
  "section": "A",
  "text": "Statement 2\nNormative Normative\nNormative Positive\nPositive Normative\nPositive Positive\n\n3\n(b) Explain the likely impact of migration on the wage level of engineers in Poland.\n(4)",
